list.item:
Hiss, Dieter, staff member, Office of
                                the Chancellor of the Federal Republic of Germany, until 1978;
                                President, State Central Bank of Berlin, from 1978

Hua Guofeng, member of the Politburo;
                                Premier of the State Council of the People’s Republic of China until
                                1980; Chair of the Chinese Communist Party until 1981

person.note:
Assistant Secretary of State for Intelligence and Research until April 1978;
                    Assistant Secretary of State for Near Eastern and South Asian Affairs from April
                    1978 until January 1981
